            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ayubu ūnshokeja ū SEEBA",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA aho wamala kūng'wīla ū Ayubu ī mihayo yenīyī; ūng'wīla ū Elifazi ū muna Tema gīkī, “Naakūpelanīlile ū bebe na a banwani biyo a babīlī, nguno mutanihayile kūlenganīla nī ng'hana yane gīt'ūmo wītīlile ntūmami wane ū Ayubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, solagi nzagamba mpungatī na ng'ondi mpungatī; muje najo ū kūlī ntūmami wane ū Ayubu, mukafunye shitambò sha kūpemvwa kūlwa nguno ying'we. Ū ntumani wane ū Ayubu akūmulombela, nane nakwigwa ū kūlomba kwakwe natizūng'wītīla īyo īng'wigeleelilwe kūlwa būbbūūlī wing'we. A bing'we mutanihayile kūlenganīla nī ng'hana yane gīt'ūmo wītīlile ntūmami wane ū Ayubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a ba Elifazi muna Tema, nū Bilidadi muna Shūha, nū Zofali ū muna Namatī, būja būūkīīta īyo SEEBA akabawīla. Nang'hwe ū SEEBA ūkūzunya ū kūlomba kwa ng'wa Ayubu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ayubu kūshokejiwa jakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ayubu aho wamala kūbalombela a banwani biye, ū SEEBA ūnshokeja ī jakwe; nīyo būlī shikolo winhwa ng'hangala ibīlī kūtinda ūmo shalī ī kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A baana ba ng'wawe bagosha na bakīma, pye na a babo baalī bimane bakwe kūfuma kale na kale, biza a ha ng'wakwe kūlya shilīwa hamò nang'hwe. Būhooya nang'hwe mu kūnūngūja na kūng'olekeja ūmo yalī yabapīnīhagīja pyī īyo SEEBA walī wang'wenhela. Na būlī ūmò wabo ūng'winha inong'ho lya hela na pete ya zahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīlūkīla ningī no ū Ayubu ū mu shikū jakwe ī ja kū būkalīkījo, kūtinda ūmo walī ī kwandya. Ūpandīka ng'holo ningī no, jūshika shihūmbī ikūmi na shinè; ī ngamīla ūshisha shihūmbī shitandatū, ī nzīkū ja kūlīma shihūmbī shibīlī; ī nzobe ng'hīma najo shihūmbī shimò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na baana bagosha mpungatī na bashīke badatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nshīke ū wa kwandya ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Yemima; ū wa kabīlī Kezia, ū wa kadatū winhwa lina lya Keleni-hapuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a hose ū mu sī yenīyo baalī batīho bakīma basoga ba kūlenganīla na a bashīke ba ng'wa Ayubu. Ū saabo akabinha wingīji hamò na a basīza babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyo ū Ayubu akalama myaka igana na makūmi anè; ūbabona a baana bakwe na a baana babo kūshisha kū shibyalīlwe shinè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ayubu ūcha alī namhala wa myaka mingī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
